|101|    Eng|   90|
|101|    Sci|   80|
|101|    Mat|   95|
|102|    Eng|   75|
|102|    Sci|   85|
|102|    Mat|   90|
+---+-------+-----+

+---+---+---+---+
| Id|Eng|Mat|Sci|
+---+---+---+---+
|101| 90| 95| 80|
|102| 75| 90| 85|
+---+---+---+---+


